flowchart TD
  API[Job API<br/>create · cancel · status] --> DB[(Jobs store<br/>partitioned by job id)]
  DB -- "due jobs, claimed<br/>with a lease" --> S[Schedulers<br/>each owns partitions]
  S --> Q{{Execution queue}}
  Q --> W[Workers<br/>heartbeat · idempotent handlers]
  W -. "done · retry · dead" .-> DB
  DB -. "expired leases" .-> R[Reaper → due again]
